    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online game with a co-op story, session-based multiplayer, and customizable game modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play through the story campaign together</strong>, anytime \u2014 it's fully replayable with different people and approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fight in competitive modes</strong> like deathmatch, capture the flag, point control, base assault, and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Enjoy social modes</strong>, such as Mafia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Customize the game world</strong>, including the atmosphere, interface, weapons, visual styles, and gameplay rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Use the built-in editor</strong> to create custom maps and modes based on available objects and templates.<br><br><strong>Online play is session-based \u2014 you create your own game and invite friends or join someone else's session.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online game with a co-op story, session-based multiplayer, and customizable game modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Play through the story campaign together</strong>, anytime \u2014 it's fully replayable with different people and approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Fight in competitive modes</strong> like deathmatch, capture the flag, point control, base assault, and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Enjoy social modes</strong>, such as Mafia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Customize the game world</strong>, including the atmosphere, interface, weapons, visual styles, and gameplay rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Use the built-in editor</strong> to create custom maps and modes based on available objects and templates.<br><br><strong>Online play is session-based \u2014 you create your own game and invite friends or join someone else's session.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Online sandbox with co-op story missions, PvP modes, and a built-in editor. Play through the campaign with friends, join battles and social games, and customize the world, interface, and rules to your liking. Online play is session-based \u2014 you decide when and with whom to play.",
